<title>GERMANY: SGL Carbon plans '96 dividend rise.</title>
<headline>SGL Carbon plans '96 dividend rise.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   201     up 26 pct</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     288     up 23 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend				     2.20    vs 1.67 marks</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 9.00    vs 7.61 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales (already reported)	 1,775   up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Group oper profit (already reported) 324     up 25 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carbon and graphite manufacturer is SGL Carbon AG. The company said pre-tax profit includes provisions of 34 million marks which represent total costs of the five-year &quot;Leveraged Executive Asset Plan&quot; incentive programme in which 73 executives are participating.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
